      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flat_Rock%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Michael Vreeland and his five sons were the first European-American settlers in the area between 1811 and 1820.",
